        "en": "The label has conditions, age limits or notes for children; the label sentence is quoted below."
      },
      "quote": "The effectiveness of Prevnar 20 for the prevention of otitis media caused by serotypes 4, 6B, 9V, 14, 18C, 19F, and 23F has been established in individuals 6 weeks through 5 years of age [see Clinical Studies (14.1) ] .",
